      <statement><tabular valign="top">
<row>
<cell>Match each system of linear equations with the graph
that most closely matches it.  
Click on a graph to make it larger.
<ol>
<li>
<m>\left\lbrace
\begin{array}{rcl}
z \amp  = \amp  0 \\
1/z \amp  = \amp  1 \\
3z - 3 \amp  = \amp  0
\end{array}
\right.</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\left\lbrace
\begin{array}{rcl}
x \amp  = \amp  0 \\
z \amp  = \amp  1 \\
z \amp  = \amp  -1
\end{array}
\right.</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\left\lbrace
\begin{array}{rcl}
z \amp  = \amp  0 \\
y \amp  = \amp  0 \\
x+y \amp  = \amp  0
\end{array}
\right.</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\left\lbrace
\begin{array}{rcl}
x \amp  = \amp  0 \\
x - z \amp  = \amp  0 \\
z \amp  = \amp  0
\end{array}
\right.</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\left\lbrace
\begin{array}{rcl}
z \amp  = \amp  1 \\
z \amp  = \amp  0 \\
z \amp  = \amp  -1
\end{array}
\right.</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\left\lbrace
\begin{array}{rcl}
z \amp  = \amp  1 \\
3z \amp  = \amp  3 \\
-1/z \amp  = \amp  -1
\end{array}
\right.</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\left\lbrace
\begin{array}{rcl}
-x + z \amp  = \amp  1 \\
x + z \amp  = \amp  1 \\
z \amp  = \amp  -1
\end{array}
\right.</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\left\lbrace
\begin{array}{rcl}
x \amp  = \amp  0 \\
y \amp  = \amp  0 \\
z \amp  = \amp  0
\end{array}
\right.</m>
</li>
<li>
<m>\left\lbrace
\begin{array}{rcl}
x + z \amp  = \amp  1 \\
z \amp  = \amp  0 \\
3x + 3z \amp  = \amp  3
\end{array}
\right.</m>
</li>
</ol></cell>
